pan> <span begin="00:17.891" end="00:18.088">when</span> <span begin="00:18.088" end="00:18.278">I</span> <span begin="00:18.278" end="00:18.540">told</span> <span begin="00:18.540" end="00:18.736">you</span> <span begin="00:18.736" end="00:18.926">all</span> <span begin="00:18.926" end="00:19.075">my</span> <span begin="00:19.075" end="00:19.611">feelings</span> <span begin="00:19.611" end="00:20.450">that</span> <span begin="00:20.450" end="00:20.915">night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是不是话太多了</span></p><p begin="00:22.779" end="00:24.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:22.779" end="00:23.106">Is</span> <span begin="00:23.106" end="00:23.238">it</span> <span begin="00:23.238" end="00:23.761">you?</span> <span begin="00:23.761" end="00:24.014">Is</span> <span begin="00:24.014" end="00:24.202">it</span> <span begin="00:24.202" end="00:24.541">me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你吗</span></p><p begin="00:24.551" end="00:26.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:24.551" end="00:24.721">Did</span> <span begin="00:24.721" end="00:24.834">you</span> <span begin="00:24.834" end="00:25.090">find</span> <span begin="00:25.090" end="00:25.792">somebody</span> <span begin="00:25.792" end="00:26.119">better?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我吗 你是否遇见了更优秀的人</span></p><p begin="00:26.129" end="00:30.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:26.129" end="00:26.633">Someone</span> <span begin="00:26.633" end="00:27.091">who</span> <span begin="00:27.091" end="00:27.477">isn't</span> <span begin="00:27.477" end="00:27.924">me,</span> <span begin="00:27.924" end="00:28.144">'cause</span> <span begin="00:28.144" end="00:28.334">I</span> <span begin="00:28.334" end="00:28.554">know</span> <span begin="00:28.554" end="00:28.792">that</span> <span begin="00:28.792" end="00:28.977">I</span> <span begin="00:28.977" end="00:29.179">was</span> <span begin="00:29.179" end="00:2