:16.489">yeah</span></p><p begin="01:16.199" end="01:19.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:16.199" end="01:16.676">I'm</span> <span begin="01:16.676" end="01:17.140">coming</span> <span begin="01:17.140" end="01:17.539">to</span> <span begin="01:17.539" end="01:17.985">terms</span> <span begin="01:17.985" end="01:18.193">with</span> <span begin="01:18.193" end="01:18.395">a</span> <span begin="01:18.395" end="01:19.216">broken</span> <span begin="01:19.216" end="01:19.582">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心碎不已 我终于认清现实</span></p><p begin="01:19.592" end="01:23.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:19.592" end="01:19.959">I</span> <span begin="01:19.959" end="01:20.389">guess</span> <span begin="01:20.389" end="01:20.749">that</span> <span begin="01:20.749" end="01:21.588">sometimes</span> <span begin="01:21.588" end="01:21.933">good</span> <span begin="01:21.933" end="01:22.391">things</span> <span begin="01:22.391" end="01:22.652">fall</span> <span begin="01:22.652" end="01:23.391">apart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许有时 美好易逝吧</span></p><p begin="01:29.534" end="01:32.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:29.534" end="01:29.695">When</span> <span begin="01:29.695" end="01:29.842">you</span> <span begin="01:29.842" end="01:30.391">said</span> <span begin="01:30.391" end="01:30.557">it</span> <span begin="01:30.557" end="01:30.807">was</span> <span begin="01:30.807" end="01:31.230">real,</span> <span begin="01:31.230" end="01:31.456">guess</span> <span begin="01:31.456" end="01:31.652">I</span> <span begin="01:31.652" end="01:32.062">really</span> <span begin="01:32.062" end="01:32.283">did</span> <span begin="01:32.283" end="01:32.684">believe</span> <span begin="01:32.684" end="01:32.784">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我说这一切都是真的 我想我对你深信不疑</span></p><p begin="01:32.794" end="01:37.579" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:32.794" end="01:33.133">Did</span> <span begin="01:33.133" end="01:33.233">you</span> <span begin="01:33.233" end="01:33.770">fake</span> <span begin="01:33.770" end="01:33.978">how</span> <span begin="01:33.978" end="01:34.079">you</span> <span begin="01:34.079" end="01:34.550">feel</span> <span begin="01:34.550" end="01:34.847">when</span> <span begin="01:34.847" end="01:35.055">we</span> <span begin="01:35.055" end="01:35.281">parked</span> <span begin="01:35.281" end="01:35.483">down</span> <span begin="01:35.483" end="01:35.697">by</span> <span begin="01:35.697" end="01:35.917">the</span> <span begin="01:35.917" end="01:36.202">river</span> <span begin="01:36.202" end="01:36.769">that</span> <span begin="01:37.024" end="01:37.579">night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的那些感觉都是装出来的吗</span></p><p begin="01:39.415" end="01:41.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:39.415" end="01:39.986">That</span> <span begin="01:39.986" end="01:41.065">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天晚上</span></p><p begin="01:41.931" end="01:46.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:41.931" end="01:42.556">That</span> <span begin="01:42.556" end="01:42.978">night</span> <span begin="01:42.978" end="01:43.174">when</span> <span begin="01:43.174" end="01:43.406">we</span> <span begin="01:43.406" end="01:43.748">fogged</span> <span begin="01:43.748" end="01:43.938">up</span> <span begin="01:43.938" end="01:44.106">the</span> <span begin="01:44.106" end="01:44.656">windows</span> <span begin="01:44.656" end="01:44.756">in</span> <span begin="01:44.756" end="01:44.918">your</span> <span begin="01:44.918" end="01:45.286">best</span> <span begin="01:45.286" end="01:45.751">friend's</span> <span begin="01:45.751" end="01:46.094">car</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天晚上 我们在你好朋友的车里缠绵 车窗蒙上一层雾水</span></p><p begin="01:46.109" end="01:56.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:46.109" end="